WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.440
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.520 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:46.160 --> 01:47.160
Let's go.

02:06.840 --> 02:09.479
Help!

03:50.040 --> 03:51.920
Who is trespassing Liufang Pavilion?

03:56.400 --> 03:57.840
How dare a dying person

03:58.400 --> 04:00.720
ask for my name?

04:51.600 --> 04:52.840
Who on earth are you?

05:06.800 --> 05:08.280
Bad news. It's the evil spirit.

05:37.960 --> 05:39.360
Is it an earthquake?

05:39.440 --> 05:40.800
Why did the people run away scared?

05:44.680 --> 05:46.680
What are you doing?

06:11.200 --> 06:12.880
You're injured here as expected.

06:22.200 --> 06:23.560
Thank you for your concern.

06:24.400 --> 06:25.960
But we're not supposed to be so close.

06:27.800 --> 06:30.160
Are you going to kill me?

06:30.240 --> 06:32.280
I do want to kill you

06:32.360 --> 06:34.600
very, very much.

06:34.680 --> 06:36.360
I want to cut off your hands and feet

06:36.840 --> 06:38.040
and throw you

06:39.120 --> 06:41.120
into the Oblivion River
to feed the crocodiles.

06:44.960 --> 06:46.720
But I can't do that.

06:47.480 --> 06:48.400
Why?

06:55.240 --> 06:57.320
Not only will I not kill you,

06:57.400 --> 07:00.240
I also won't allow anyone to hurt you.

07:00.960 --> 07:03.800
If anyone dares to touch you,

07:03.880 --> 07:06.800
I'll cut their skin off

07:07.320 --> 07:09.040
and make a human lantern out of it.

07:11.080 --> 07:13.080
From now on,

07:13.160 --> 07:14.560
you're mine.

07:15.040 --> 07:16.680
Your life belongs to me.

07:17.240 --> 07:19.000
Your breathing belongs to me.

07:19.480 --> 07:21.360
Your heartbeat belongs to me.

07:21.440 --> 07:23.920
Every drop of blood in your body

07:24.000 --> 07:25.440
belongs to me.

07:25.520 --> 07:28.560
Without my permission,
don't leave my sight.

07:32.520 --> 07:34.320
He said I belong to him?

07:35.480 --> 07:36.720
Is he…

07:39.720 --> 07:42.480
This immortal criminal has been locked up
in Haotian Tower.

07:42.560 --> 07:43.800
He has barely seen the world.

07:44.400 --> 07:47.400
I'm the first fairy he has seen
in a long time.

07:47.480 --> 07:49.080
And that unexpectedly happened…

07:49.160 --> 07:51.960
Is he in love with me?

07:54.640 --> 07:57.560
I appreciate your kindness.

07:58.040 --> 08:00.680
But we're basically strangers.

08:01.360 --> 08:03.880
There are plenty of fish in the sea.

08:04.600 --> 08:07.360
You should go find someone else.

08:10.000 --> 08:11.600
Break my spell.

08:12.160 --> 08:13.080
What spell?

08:15.720 --> 08:17.760
The Xilan Holy Seal?

08:24.560 --> 08:25.680
You know it.

08:26.920 --> 08:28.840
I've only seen it in books.

08:28.920 --> 08:30.360
It's the totem of the Xilan Tribe.

08:30.440 --> 08:32.159
But you've got the wrong person.

08:32.240 --> 08:34.240
I'm just an ordinary orchid plant.

08:34.320 --> 08:36.600
If I could unlock such an advanced spell,

08:36.679 --> 08:38.840
would I need to worry
about the immortal examination?

08:47.720 --> 08:49.280
This is your true form.

08:49.840 --> 08:51.800
How can your immortal roots
decay like this?

08:51.880 --> 08:54.160
You Little Immortal Criminal!
What are you doing?

08:54.240 --> 08:56.200
How can you peek into my privacy?

08:56.280 --> 08:57.360
How outrageous!

10:05.040 --> 10:05.960
My lord.

11:04.600 --> 11:07.040
LIUFANG PAVILION, HAISHI

11:09.560 --> 11:11.200
You entrusted me with Haishi.

11:11.280 --> 11:12.800
But I've violated your trust

11:12.880 --> 11:14.520
to have someone take away
the Destiny Book.

11:14.600 --> 11:15.560
I deserve to die.

11:16.960 --> 11:18.200
You do deserve to die.

11:19.320 --> 11:21.840
But death is too easy for you.

11:22.800 --> 11:25.040
The Destiny Book is the key to all plans.

11:25.640 --> 11:27.320
You don't even have the right to die

11:28.440 --> 11:29.920
until it's reclaimed.

11:30.800 --> 11:32.360
I will retrieve it

11:32.440 --> 11:33.440
to redeem myself.

11:34.120 --> 11:35.640
Do you have any idea

11:35.720 --> 11:38.120
who the mysterious man
that haunted Haishi is?

11:39.240 --> 11:40.920
Anyone of great power in the three realms,

11:41.000 --> 11:42.800
I'll know whoever he is.

11:43.320 --> 11:44.680
But his power is unfathomable.

11:45.240 --> 11:46.680
I don't know who he is.

11:50.560 --> 11:52.040
Do you think I have time

11:52.120 --> 11:53.720
to listen to your nonsense?

11:53.800 --> 11:54.840
But my lord,

11:56.760 --> 11:58.400
there is still a trace
of the Destiny Book.

12:00.040 --> 12:01.200
Go ahead.

12:02.600 --> 12:04.520
The person who stole it
is from Shuiyuntian.

12:09.800 --> 12:15.040
OBLIVION RIVER

12:15.760 --> 12:17.760
The Xilan Holy Seal is so powerful

12:18.320 --> 12:20.080
that even I can't break it.

12:21.240 --> 12:24.080
The seal has reappeared again
after 30,000 years of disappearance.

12:24.680 --> 12:25.600
What a strange thing.

12:27.080 --> 12:28.840
It has disappeared for 30,000 years?

12:29.680 --> 12:31.200
My lord, what you don't know is,

12:31.960 --> 12:33.600
since the end of the Great War,

12:33.680 --> 12:35.440
the Xilan Tribe, including the fairy,

12:35.520 --> 12:36.440
was wiped out.

12:37.160 --> 12:39.800
If the Orchid Spirit is indeed
a surviving member of the Xilan Tribe,

12:40.480 --> 12:42.480
I'm afraid you can do nothing
to her again, my lord.

12:43.920 --> 12:44.840
Why?

12:44.920 --> 12:47.320
Since the beginning of the universe,

12:48.080 --> 12:50.600
the Xilan Tribe has lived
in a corner of Xishan

12:50.680 --> 12:52.800
to guard the three realms
from the evil gods.

12:52.880 --> 12:54.400
They have always remained neutral

12:54.480 --> 12:55.840
and have never been involved in strife.

12:56.560 --> 12:57.680
It would be unethical

12:59.360 --> 13:00.280
to attack Xilan.

13:02.760 --> 13:04.320
What evil gods?

13:05.320 --> 13:07.240
It's just some ancient legend.

13:08.120 --> 13:10.320
I've dominated the three realms
and never had a weakness.

13:11.080 --> 13:12.480
How can I relate my life

13:12.560 --> 13:14.960
to a mere flower spirit?

13:16.160 --> 13:17.040
Yes.

13:18.160 --> 13:19.280
I said something wrong.

13:26.960 --> 13:27.960
My lord, you…

13:32.520 --> 13:34.360
This tear.

13:46.120 --> 13:47.320
It's her again.

13:53.800 --> 13:55.440
It has been a long day.

13:55.520 --> 13:59.600
I lost the most important Universe Pill.

13:59.680 --> 14:01.240
If I can't cure my immortal root,

14:01.760 --> 14:04.040
how can I attend the immortal examination?

14:04.120 --> 14:06.760
I won't be able to go
to the Fountain Palace.

14:06.840 --> 14:09.640
It's all because of
that damned immortal criminal.

14:12.400 --> 14:17.480
SPIRIT LOCK GATE, SHUIYUNTIAN

14:29.440 --> 14:30.920
Something's wrong.

14:31.000 --> 14:32.520
Nothing is wrong. It's just the wind.

14:32.600 --> 14:33.800
Don't be paranoid.

14:45.120 --> 14:46.240
Lord Changheng!

14:46.720 --> 14:48.080
I'll surely pass the immortal examination.

14:48.160 --> 14:50.240
I will definitely enter
the Fountain Palace!

14:52.720 --> 14:53.640
No way.

14:53.720 --> 14:55.480
I can't give up just like this.

14:56.280 --> 14:57.600
I still have to go to Haishi.

15:18.000 --> 15:19.560
ARBITER HALL

15:19.640 --> 15:21.120
How come it's you again?

15:21.200 --> 15:22.840
How did you find this place?

15:22.920 --> 15:24.960
No matter where you are in the world,

15:25.040 --> 15:26.240
I will find you

15:26.720 --> 15:28.600
and make sure you're safe.

15:32.960 --> 15:34.040
Don't.

15:34.120 --> 15:35.600
I appreciate your kindness.

15:35.680 --> 15:37.120
You are an immortal criminal at large.

15:37.200 --> 15:39.320
If people find out I'm with you,

15:39.400 --> 15:41.160
I'd be in big trouble.

15:41.240 --> 15:43.560
If you really want
to make sure of my safety,

15:43.640 --> 15:45.920
you should stay away
and don't come looking for me again.

15:46.480 --> 15:48.080
If you break the spell,

15:48.160 --> 15:49.480
I will leave on my own.

15:50.120 --> 15:51.000
I…

15:54.000 --> 15:55.720
Didn't I tell you?

15:55.800 --> 15:58.440
I am not a member of the Xilan Tribe.

15:58.520 --> 16:01.520
I'm just a seed that was picked up

16:01.600 --> 16:03.000
from Yunmeng Lake,

16:03.680 --> 16:05.400
an ordinary orchid plant

16:05.480 --> 16:08.160
cultivated in a pot at the Arbiter Hall.

16:11.560 --> 16:12.800
If you play dumb again,

16:13.680 --> 16:14.760
I'll seriously hurt you.

16:24.040 --> 16:26.160
How can this man change his face
at the drop of a hat?

16:30.280 --> 16:31.680
You…

16:31.760 --> 16:32.680
Stop there.

16:33.800 --> 16:36.200
I'm not afraid of you.

16:36.280 --> 16:37.160
I'm warning you.

16:37.240 --> 16:38.800
This is Shuiyuntian.

16:39.480 --> 16:41.400
If you dare to hurt me even a little bit,

16:41.480 --> 16:43.680
those heavenly soldiers
will definitely not let you go.

16:46.880 --> 16:49.640
There is nothing I wouldn't dare to do.

16:50.320 --> 16:51.520
But as I said,

16:52.720 --> 16:53.640
I won't hurt you.

16:56.000 --> 16:57.720
He's really scared.

17:01.240 --> 17:02.280
That's good.

17:02.360 --> 17:03.600
I have important things to do.

17:03.680 --> 17:06.319
You should also go back
and turn yourself in at the Haotian Tower.

17:06.400 --> 17:07.599
Don't follow me anymore.

17:18.240 --> 17:19.359
Little Flower Spirit.

17:20.720 --> 17:22.800
Do you think
I can't do anything about you?

17:28.359 --> 17:31.640
He's bluffing and waffling on.

17:32.200 --> 17:34.320
He's not looking for an excuse

17:34.400 --> 17:35.680
to see me, right?

17:37.640 --> 17:38.480
Let go of me.

17:43.160 --> 17:44.120
Let go of me!

17:53.120 --> 17:54.000
Wait.

17:54.080 --> 17:56.080
You can't read the Destiny Book
as an immortal criminal.

17:56.680 --> 17:57.560
Give it back!

17:59.680 --> 18:01.360
Don't read it!

18:01.840 --> 18:04.080
Give it back to me.

18:04.800 --> 18:06.080
Give it back!

18:24.760 --> 18:26.320
Lady Chidi.

18:37.080 --> 18:38.600
It's Lady Chidi.

18:39.960 --> 18:41.920
She still has a vestige
of her primordial spirit

18:42.000 --> 18:43.280
in the mortal world.

18:45.000 --> 18:45.920
What exactly happened

18:46.800 --> 18:48.200
30,000 years ago?

18:51.560 --> 18:53.560
Who cares how she got
to keep her primordial spirit?

18:54.400 --> 18:55.400
With her,

18:56.200 --> 18:58.680
I can unseal 100,000 soldiers.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.640
How dare you still read it?

19:07.720 --> 19:09.760
If you mess with the Destiny Book
and change karma,

19:09.840 --> 19:11.680
you'll be destroyed, do you know that?

19:11.760 --> 19:13.400
I'm doing this for your good.

19:57.320 --> 19:59.560
My lord, have you lost
something important?

20:00.840 --> 20:01.680
No.

20:02.400 --> 20:04.880
Recently, you seem to have
something on your mind.

20:06.280 --> 20:07.680
I would like to share your worries.

20:07.760 --> 20:08.800
It's nothing.

20:09.640 --> 20:11.080
You can leave now.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.080
Yes.

20:25.400 --> 20:29.280
FIVE HUNDRED YEARS AGO

21:09.520 --> 21:10.800
Are you all right?

21:14.760 --> 21:15.600
My lord,

21:15.680 --> 21:17.960
after the escape of the immortal criminals
from Haotian Tower,

21:18.040 --> 21:20.240
we've searched the entire Shuiyuntian

21:20.320 --> 21:21.400
as you ordered.

21:21.480 --> 21:23.160
We didn't find anything wrong,

21:23.240 --> 21:24.360
nor did we suffer any losses.

21:26.400 --> 21:28.120
Has the Arbiter Hall also been checked?

21:28.920 --> 21:30.560
Not yet.

21:33.840 --> 21:34.880
Why not?

21:35.440 --> 21:37.000
The Arbiter Hall is in a remote location

21:37.080 --> 21:38.640
and has been unoccupied for a long time.

21:38.720 --> 21:40.160
It was my negligence.

21:40.240 --> 21:41.560
Who said it was unoccupied?

21:41.640 --> 21:43.640
It's my fault. I'll go and check it now.

21:43.720 --> 21:44.640
No need.

21:45.640 --> 21:46.560
I'll go myself.

21:52.120 --> 21:54.400
I underestimated you,
Little Flower Spirit.

21:55.120 --> 21:57.200
Not only do you know the mysterious spell,

21:57.280 --> 21:59.560
but you also have the Destiny Book
in your hands.

22:00.480 --> 22:01.800
What are you talking about?

22:01.880 --> 22:03.640
I don't understand a word.

22:03.720 --> 22:05.800
Put me down now!

22:10.280 --> 22:11.600
Are you still trying to play dumb?

22:11.680 --> 22:14.520
Even I thought she's gone to dust.

22:14.600 --> 22:17.360
But she's only in the mortal world
for destined suffering.

22:17.920 --> 22:20.800
Where did you learn this trick?

22:20.880 --> 22:22.520
I'm telling the truth.

22:22.600 --> 22:25.040
I found the Destiny Book yesterday
at Haishi.

22:25.120 --> 22:26.920
I don't even know who it belongs to.

22:27.000 --> 22:28.840
You really didn't keep it yourself?

22:28.920 --> 22:30.280
All the Destiny Books

22:30.360 --> 22:32.040
should have been placed
in the Arbiter Hall.

22:32.120 --> 22:33.440
I saw it in Haishi,

22:33.520 --> 22:35.080
so I brought it back.

22:39.240 --> 22:40.480
Let me ask you.

22:40.560 --> 22:42.400
Where is Arbiter now?

22:42.960 --> 22:44.720
Why are you asking for my master again?

22:44.800 --> 22:46.120
Didn't I tell you?

22:46.200 --> 22:48.400
She has been wandering around Yunmeng Lake

22:48.480 --> 22:50.320
for over a thousand years.

22:55.960 --> 22:56.960
You're her disciple?

22:57.920 --> 22:59.840
I'm her only disciple.

22:59.920 --> 23:01.840
Then you must be able
to fix the Destiny Book too.

23:01.920 --> 23:03.240
Of course.

23:09.440 --> 23:10.520
Little Flower Spirit,

23:10.600 --> 23:12.920
I want you to do something for me.

23:13.600 --> 23:14.640
Otherwise,

23:15.680 --> 23:17.960
I will set fire to your greenhouse.

23:25.800 --> 23:27.360
ARBITER HALL

23:54.360 --> 23:56.240
Lord Changheng.

23:56.320 --> 23:58.800
Immortal criminals have escaped.
Did they harass the Arbiter Hall?

23:58.880 --> 24:00.240
The Arbiter Hall is very safe.

24:00.320 --> 24:03.080
No one came to rob the Destiny Book
nor burn the greenhouse.

24:03.960 --> 24:04.920
Burn the greenhouse?

24:14.760 --> 24:15.840
Where is the young disciple

24:15.920 --> 24:17.800
who is always around Arbiter?

24:17.880 --> 24:19.040
Why haven't I seen her today?

24:19.920 --> 24:22.120
Orchid

24:22.200 --> 24:24.760
is recently in seclusion
to prepare for the immortal examination.

24:28.520 --> 24:29.640
All right.

24:30.400 --> 24:31.240
Lord Changheng.

24:32.040 --> 24:33.680
Would you like to come in

24:33.760 --> 24:36.000
and look around for her
in the Arbiter Hall?

24:37.080 --> 24:38.440
If you can give her some guidance,

24:38.520 --> 24:39.720
she'll make great improvements.

24:42.360 --> 24:45.000
My lord, please look for her.

24:46.720 --> 24:47.960
That's not necessary.

24:48.040 --> 24:49.960
I was going to ask her
when Arbiter would return.

24:50.040 --> 24:52.080
Since she's busy, I won't bother her.

24:54.360 --> 24:55.280
Wait…

25:03.560 --> 25:06.760
ARBITER HALL

25:19.200 --> 25:20.680
I didn't say anything wrong.

25:20.760 --> 25:22.120
Please let Orchid go.

25:30.600 --> 25:31.600
Don't cry.

25:34.040 --> 25:36.600
It's all your fault.

25:37.560 --> 25:40.880
It's rare for Lord Changheng
to ask about me.

25:43.240 --> 25:44.320
It's all your fault.

25:44.960 --> 25:46.200
Ever since I met you,

25:46.280 --> 25:47.520
I've been unlucky.

25:47.600 --> 25:48.920
I lost the Universe Pill

25:49.000 --> 25:51.280
that I went through
all the trouble to buy.

25:51.360 --> 25:52.480
I've also lost the elixir.

25:52.560 --> 25:54.440
Now I can't even cure my immortal root.

25:54.520 --> 25:56.400
Do you know how sad I am?

26:00.120 --> 26:01.680
I wish I didn't know.

26:07.000 --> 26:08.080
Yes, I do.

26:10.320 --> 26:11.960
How could you possibly know?

26:15.800 --> 26:17.720
What you want is this, right?

26:19.320 --> 26:20.560
The Universe Pill?

26:23.680 --> 26:24.840
Give it to me.

26:26.960 --> 26:29.120
Fix the Destiny Book,
then I'll give it to you.

26:48.760 --> 26:51.000
Master only taught me
how to organize the Destiny Books.

26:51.080 --> 26:54.320
She never taught me how to fix
a broken Destiny Book like this.

27:06.640 --> 27:08.440
Are you really a disciple of the Arbiter?

27:09.000 --> 27:09.920
Of course.

27:10.000 --> 27:11.680
I'm the only disciple of my master.

27:12.240 --> 27:14.960
Since you are,
why are you doing it so wrongly?

27:15.040 --> 27:16.160
You…

27:18.600 --> 27:21.120
Think about how hard I've worked today.

27:21.200 --> 27:22.520
I almost lost my life

27:22.600 --> 27:23.680
in Haishi.

27:23.760 --> 27:24.920
I was so scared.

27:25.000 --> 27:26.160
And look,

27:26.240 --> 27:28.520
I now have bruises all over my body.

27:28.600 --> 27:29.920
They hurt so much.

27:30.000 --> 27:31.880
I'm also being threatened, scared,

27:31.960 --> 27:33.720
and pinched by you.

27:33.800 --> 27:35.320
I'm really tired.

27:41.840 --> 27:42.960
But don't worry.

27:43.480 --> 27:44.680
After I rest for one night,

27:44.760 --> 27:46.160
I'll fix it tomorrow.

27:54.160 --> 27:55.080
All right.

27:55.800 --> 27:56.760
In that case,

27:57.360 --> 27:58.800
where will I sleep tonight?

27:59.760 --> 28:01.280
How do I know where you'll be sleeping?

28:06.560 --> 28:08.800
You're not going to stay here, are you?

28:10.200 --> 28:11.480
No!

28:11.560 --> 28:12.760
You can't stay here.

28:12.840 --> 28:13.720
Go!

28:13.800 --> 28:14.720
That's fine.

28:15.440 --> 28:17.280
Where do you want
to spend the night with me?

28:18.120 --> 28:19.120
With you?

28:19.720 --> 28:21.840
No, I'll stay here tonight.

28:21.920 --> 28:22.880
No way.

28:23.800 --> 28:24.880
I told you,

28:24.960 --> 28:26.320
you belong to me.

28:26.400 --> 28:27.960
I can go,

28:28.040 --> 28:30.480
only if you stay with me.

28:32.440 --> 28:34.400
I mean,

28:34.480 --> 28:37.120
I'm just an ordinary fairy in Shuiyuntian.

28:38.640 --> 28:41.320
Although my power and appearance
are not worth mentioning,

28:41.400 --> 28:42.720
I'm still on the list.

28:42.800 --> 28:44.960
You should consider my reputation,
all right?

28:45.760 --> 28:48.160
Besides, if I'm running around like this,

28:48.240 --> 28:49.400
how can I get my strength back

28:49.480 --> 28:50.480
and fix the Destiny Book?

28:50.560 --> 28:53.000
Anyway, I'm staying here tonight.
I'm not going anywhere.

29:00.160 --> 29:01.400
That's a good point.

29:02.320 --> 29:04.160
Then let's stay
in the Arbiter Hall tonight.

29:05.560 --> 29:06.520
So…

29:09.640 --> 29:11.480
Where will I sleep tonight?

29:29.720 --> 29:32.080
This is my master's room.

29:58.400 --> 29:59.520
Although it's somehow small,

30:00.240 --> 30:01.840
I can make do with it.

30:03.880 --> 30:05.200
Small?

30:05.280 --> 30:06.600
This is small?

30:07.160 --> 30:08.960
Did you use to live in a palace?

30:09.720 --> 30:11.640
My master is out on a trip.

30:11.720 --> 30:13.720
She won't be back for a while.

30:13.800 --> 30:15.480
No one lives here.

30:15.560 --> 30:17.080
If you stay here,

30:17.160 --> 30:19.320
don't ever wander around.

30:19.400 --> 30:21.680
If someone finds out
I'm hiding an immortal criminal,

30:21.760 --> 30:22.800
we'll be both screwed.

30:26.080 --> 30:27.400
With me here,

30:27.480 --> 30:30.040
no one will dare to hurt you.

30:30.680 --> 30:32.440
It's enough to tell a lie once.

30:32.520 --> 30:34.600
Why do you take it
more and more seriously?

30:36.400 --> 30:37.320
Where are you going?

30:38.800 --> 30:40.440
I'm going to sleep.

30:40.520 --> 30:41.720
It has been such a long day.

30:41.800 --> 30:42.800
I'm exhausted.

30:42.880 --> 30:44.000
Aren't you tired?

30:46.760 --> 30:48.760
Right, the blanket and pillow
are over there.

30:48.840 --> 30:49.680
Get it yourself.

30:49.760 --> 30:50.840
Stop there.

31:03.760 --> 31:05.600
I'll say it again.

31:06.160 --> 31:07.480
From now on,

31:07.560 --> 31:09.200
don't leave my sight.

31:09.280 --> 31:10.640
Don't go anywhere else.

31:11.480 --> 31:12.720
Sleep right here.

31:16.320 --> 31:17.360
You Little Immortal Criminal.

31:17.440 --> 31:20.360
Have you been locked up for so long
that you've lost your mind?

31:20.440 --> 31:22.280
You don't even know
the rituals of Shuiyuntian.

31:22.360 --> 31:24.320
Male body, female body.

31:24.400 --> 31:26.120
We have to sleep separately.

31:26.200 --> 31:28.080
It's already against the rules

31:28.160 --> 31:29.880
to stay in the Arbiter Hall alone.

31:30.440 --> 31:31.840
If we even sleep in the same bed,

31:31.920 --> 31:33.200
you…

31:34.400 --> 31:35.240
What will happen?

31:36.280 --> 31:37.200
Then…

31:38.960 --> 31:41.520
Forget it. I won't waste my time with you.
I'm going to bed.

31:49.920 --> 31:50.960
Right.

31:52.240 --> 31:53.680
I have something else to tell you.

31:53.760 --> 31:54.920
Go ahead.

31:56.480 --> 31:58.000
I already have someone I like.

32:00.040 --> 32:02.120
Whom you like is none of my business.

32:02.960 --> 32:04.520
But you belong to me.

32:04.600 --> 32:05.600
If…

32:23.320 --> 32:24.280
You…

32:25.400 --> 32:26.920
Why are you here?

32:34.120 --> 32:35.440
I told you.

32:35.520 --> 32:37.560
You are not to leave my sight.

32:38.840 --> 32:39.920
I also said

32:40.000 --> 32:41.680
we'll sleep in our own rooms.

32:41.760 --> 32:42.680
Go back now!

32:44.200 --> 32:45.480
Are you threatening me?

32:46.360 --> 32:48.040
It's not like I've never done this before.

32:56.040 --> 32:57.200
All right.

32:57.280 --> 32:58.280
Fine.

32:58.360 --> 33:00.120
You like it here.

33:00.200 --> 33:02.160
Fine, you sleep here and I'll go.

33:07.280 --> 33:08.600
You're not allowed to go anywhere.

33:10.120 --> 33:11.600
Are you done?

33:11.680 --> 33:13.720
You're already a few thousand years old!

33:13.800 --> 33:14.840
Let me tell you.

33:14.920 --> 33:16.200
I've only known you for one day,

33:16.280 --> 33:18.840
but I've never been more annoyed
in the past 1,000 years!

33:19.640 --> 33:21.640
I can only keep you out of danger

33:21.720 --> 33:24.600
when I can see you.

33:25.080 --> 33:26.080
To me,

33:26.160 --> 33:28.840
you're the only danger
in the whole Yujing.

33:59.520 --> 34:00.680
I hit my head.

34:00.760 --> 34:01.640
Why are you moaning?

34:04.640 --> 34:05.640
I'm ordering you

34:06.280 --> 34:07.920
not to hurt yourself anymore.

34:09.239 --> 34:10.800
This Little Immortal Criminal

34:10.880 --> 34:12.400
is quite caring though.

34:21.360 --> 34:24.320
Neither of us can sleep well

34:24.400 --> 34:26.120
like this.

34:26.199 --> 34:27.120
How about

34:27.199 --> 34:28.719
you go back to your room?

34:35.360 --> 34:36.920
Then I'll come back tomorrow morning.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.760
- What are you doing?
- Come with me!

35:23.360 --> 35:24.400
Little Immortal Criminal?
